sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as bor-agent
    participant PS as PolicyServer<br/>(policy port, mTLS)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Agent: at daemon start-up only
    Agent->>Agent: CertExpiringSoon(agent.crt, 30 days)?
    alt expires within 30 days
        Agent->>Agent: new ECDSA P-256 key, CSR with same CN
        Agent->>PS: RenewCertificate(csr_pem) using current cert
        PS->>PS: interceptor - verified chain, serial not revoked
        PS->>DB: look up node by certificate CN
        PS->>PS: SignCSR (CN = node name, 90 days)
        PS->>DB: update node cert serial and expiry
        PS-->>Agent: signed_cert_pem
        Agent->>Agent: write agent.key, then agent.crt
    end
    Agent->>PS: connect policy stream with current credentials
